- add independent problem-size n and network-size N;
- measure scaling surfaces C(A,n,N), not four constants;
- distinguish discovery, verification, and coordination complexity;
- test architecture-relative polynomial classes only after the cost model is fixed.

I’m recording both the useful ideas and the overreach in the repository.

